---
// Star schema vs one big table (OBT), with the numbers Michael Kaminsky published for Fivetran
// (Aug 2022, TPC-DS "100" subset): disk used in Redshift, and the query-time improvement of the
// denormalized table per warehouse. All numbers are read off that post; nothing is simulated.

const W = 900;
const H = 418;
const labelX = 20;
const barX = 220;
const barMax = 610; // px for the largest scale value

// Part A: disk (MB), from the post's table of Redshift sizes.
const factMB = 29778;
const dimsMB = 8 + 31 + 32 + 56; // household_demographics, date_dim, store, customer_address
const starMB = factMB + dimsMB;
const obtMB = 60250;
const diskMax = 65000;
const mbX = (mb: number) => barX + (mb / diskMax) * barMax;
const fmtEn = (n: number) => n.toLocaleString('en-US');
const fmtVi = (n: number) => n.toLocaleString('vi-VN');
const diskTicks = [0, 20000, 40000, 60000];

// Part B: query time saved by OBT vs star, per warehouse (Redshift excludes compile time).
type Speed = { name: string; lo: number; hi: number; en: string; vi: string };
const speeds: Speed[] = [
  { name: 'Redshift', lo: 25, hi: 30, en: '25–30%', vi: '25–30%' },
  { name: 'Snowflake', lo: 25, hi: 25, en: '~25%', vi: '~25%' },
  { name: 'BigQuery', lo: 49, hi: 49, en: '~50% (49% on average)', vi: '~50% (trung bình 49%)' },
];
const pctMax = 70;
const pctX = (p: number) => barX + (p / pctMax) * barMax;
const pctTicks = [0, 10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 70];

const aTop = 20;
const bTop = 214;
const barH = 26;
---
<figure class="dmso">
  <div class="dmso-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label={`In Redshift the star schema used ${fmtEn(starMB)} MB and the one big table ${fmtEn(obtMB)} MB. The one big table answered queries 25 to 30 percent faster in Redshift, about 25 percent faster in Snowflake and about 50 percent faster in BigQuery.`}>
    {/* Part A: disk */}
    <text x={labelX} y={aTop + 4} class="dmso-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Disk used in Redshift</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Dung lượng đĩa trên Redshift</tspan>
    </text>
    {diskTicks.map((t) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={mbX(t)} x2={mbX(t)} y1={aTop + 24} y2={aTop + 128} class="dmso-grid" />
        <text x={mbX(t)} y={aTop + 146} text-anchor="middle" class="dmso-tick">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{t === 0 ? '0' : `${fmtEn(t)} MB`}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{t === 0 ? '0' : `${fmtVi(t)} MB`}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <text x={labelX} y={aTop + 56} class="dmso-label">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Star schema</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Star schema</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x={barX} y={aTop + 38} width={mbX(factMB) - barX} height={barH} class="dmso-bar" />
    <rect x={mbX(factMB)} y={aTop + 38} width={Math.max(2, mbX(starMB) - mbX(factMB))} height={barH} class="dmso-bar is-dim" />
    <text x={mbX(starMB) + 10} y={aTop + 56} class="dmso-val">
      <tspan data-lang-en>{fmtEn(starMB)} MB (dimension tables: {dimsMB} MB)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>{fmtVi(starMB)} MB (các bảng dimension: {dimsMB} MB)</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x={labelX} y={aTop + 100} class="dmso-label">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One big table</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>One big table</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x={barX} y={aTop + 82} width={mbX(obtMB) - barX} height={barH} class="dmso-bar is-accent" />
    <text x={mbX(obtMB) + 10} y={aTop + 100} class="dmso-val is-accent">
      <tspan data-lang-en>{fmtEn(obtMB)} MB</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>{fmtVi(obtMB)} MB</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1={bTop - 34} y2={bTop - 34} class="dmso-rule" />

    {/* Part B: speed-up */}
    <text x={labelX} y={bTop} class="dmso-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Query time saved by the one big table</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thời gian truy vấn tiết kiệm được nhờ one big table</tspan>
    </text>
    {pctTicks.map((t) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={pctX(t)} x2={pctX(t)} y1={bTop + 20} y2={bTop + 140} class="dmso-grid" />
        <text x={pctX(t)} y={bTop + 158} text-anchor="middle" class="dmso-tick">{t}%</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    {speeds.map((s, i) => {
      const y = bTop + 32 + i * 38;
      return (
        <g>
          <text x={labelX} y={y + 18} class="dmso-label">{s.name}</text>
          <rect x={barX} y={y} width={pctX(s.lo) - barX} height={barH} class={i === 2 ? 'dmso-bar is-accent' : 'dmso-bar'} />
          {s.hi > s.lo && <rect x={pctX(s.lo)} y={y} width={pctX(s.hi) - pctX(s.lo)} height={barH} class="dmso-bar is-range" />}
          <text x={pctX(s.hi) + 10} y={y + 18} class={i === 2 ? 'dmso-val is-accent' : 'dmso-val'}>
            <tspan data-lang-en>{s.en}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{s.vi}</tspan>
          </text>
        </g>
      );
    })}
    <text x={labelX} y={H - 8} class="dmso-foot">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Snowflake was mixed: the star schema won three of the simpler queries.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Snowflake không đồng đều: star schema thắng ở ba truy vấn đơn giản hơn.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Pre-joining the dimensions into every sales row doubled the disk, and the dimension tables themselves were tiny. In return, the reports ran faster on all three warehouses. Numbers from Michael Kaminsky's 2022 benchmark for Fivetran on a subset of TPC-DS "100"; the Redshift figure excludes query compilation time.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Join sẵn các bảng dimension vào từng dòng bán hàng làm dung lượng đĩa tăng gấp đôi, dù bản thân các bảng dimension rất nhỏ. Đổi lại, báo cáo chạy nhanh hơn trên cả ba warehouse. Số liệu từ benchmark năm 2022 của Michael Kaminsky cho Fivetran, trên một phần bộ TPC-DS "100"; số của Redshift không tính thời gian biên dịch query.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dmso {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .dmso-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .dmso svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .dmso text {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dmso .dmso-h {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .dmso .dmso-label {
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .dmso .dmso-tick,
  .dmso .dmso-foot {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .dmso-grid {
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .dmso-rule {
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .dmso-bar {
    fill: var(--text-faint);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .dmso-bar.is-dim {
    fill: var(--text);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .dmso-bar.is-accent {
    fill: var(--red);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .dmso-bar.is-range {
    fill: var(--text-faint);
    opacity: 0.25;
  }
  .dmso .dmso-val.is-accent {
    fill: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .dmso figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
